<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI 工程与职业速报</title><link>https://minhmuot7cu0niw-sudo.github.io/ai-engineering-career-digest</link><description>AI 工程学习与职业判断速报</description><item><title>Google DeepMind 与新加坡政府发布端侧反诈骗 AI 工具</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/</guid><description>DeepMind 与新加坡 GovTech 使用轻量级端侧 Gemma 模型，在私聊场景中拦截对话式诈骗，并强调零云端数据外流。</description><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/">Google DeepMind</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Ollama 0.40.4 在 CLI 中加入决策模型调用</title><link>https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.4</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.4</guid><description>可通过 ollama run 直接执行是/否判断、文本标签分类和基于量规的评分，例如对工单判断是否请求退款。</description><source url="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.4">GitHub Release: ollama/ollama</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.299 增加文件提及控制与终端空闲压缩</title><link>https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.299</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.299</guid><description>新增 CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_FILE_MENTIONS 环境变量；@ 文件提及时模型获得路径并使用文件工具读取，而非直接取得文件内容。终端中的超长闲置会话也加入了压缩机制。</description><source url="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.299">GitHub Release: anthropics/claude-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Mano-P：无云依赖的端侧 GUI Agent 部署</title><link>https://github.com/Mininglamp-AI/Mano-P</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/Mininglamp-AI/Mano-P</guid><description>项目主题是搭建不依赖云服务的端侧 GUI Agent。</description><source url="https://github.com/Mininglamp-AI/Mano-P">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>GenClass：10 MB 浏览器内模型捕捉不抛异常的缺陷</title><link>https://www.npmjs.com/package/@genclass/runtime</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.npmjs.com/package/@genclass/runtime</guid><description>GenClass 宣称提供一个约 10 MB、可在浏览器中运行的模型，用于发现不会抛出异常的 bug。</description><source url="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@genclass/runtime">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>LLM 代码翻译中的类型映射问题</title><link>https://www.codemetal.ai/research/apples-to-apples-getting-type-mappings-right-in-llm-based-code-translation</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.codemetal.ai/research/apples-to-apples-getting-type-mappings-right-in-llm-based-code-translation</guid><description>研究主题聚焦 LLM 驱动代码翻译时如何正确处理类型映射。</description><source url="https://www.codemetal.ai/research/apples-to-apples-getting-type-mappings-right-in-llm-based-code-translation">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Qwen Code 更新托管 Agent 连接器与 broker 稳健性</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.25.2-preview.0</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.25.2-preview.0</guid><description>预览版更新说明包含对 managed-agent 的 connector 与 broker 稳健性修复。</description><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.25.2-preview.0">GitHub Release: QwenLM/qwen-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>学习本地决策模型的评测与集成</title><link>https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.4</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.4</guid><description>Ollama 已支持在命令行中直接以决策模型完成判断、分类和评分任务。</description><source url="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.4">GitHub Release: ollama/ollama</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>学习代码翻译的类型契约验证</title><link>https://www.codemetal.ai/research/apples-to-apples-getting-type-mappings-right-in-llm-based-code-translation</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.codemetal.ai/research/apples-to-apples-getting-type-mappings-right-in-llm-based-code-translation</guid><description>该研究讨论 LLM 代码翻译中的类型映射正确性。</description><source url="https://www.codemetal.ai/research/apples-to-apples-getting-type-mappings-right-in-llm-based-code-translation">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>端侧隐私 AI 正在进入高风险公共服务场景</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/</guid><description>DeepMind 与新加坡 GovTech 的合作将轻量级端侧模型用于私聊反诈骗，且不向云端传出数据。</description><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/on-device-ai-scam-detection-mddi/">Google DeepMind</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Agent 系统的基础设施可靠性成为落地能力</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.25.2-preview.0</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.25.2-preview.0</guid><description>Qwen Code 的预览版将 managed-agent 的连接器和 broker 稳健性列为修复内容。</description><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.25.2-preview.0">GitHub Release: QwenLM/qwen-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item></channel></rss>
